OL,3,C'We want to do anything we can':
OL,4,CTourists aid French wildfire fight
OL,6,FTwo holidaymakers from Jersey are
OL,7,Fsupporting efforts to donate essential
OL,8,Fsupplies to firefighters and the
OL,9,Fhundreds of thousands of people
OL,10,Fdisplaced by the ongoing wildfire near
OL,11,FBordeaux in south-west France.
OL,13,FPedro Vieira and Madi Robson were
OL,14,Ftravelling south when they began to
OL,15,Funderstand the scale of the blaze,
OL,16,Fwhich has just seen another 4,000
OL,17,Fresidents ordered to leave their homes
OL,18,Fahead of another heatwave in Europe.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/4
