OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1785426509
OL,3,C'We want to do anything we can':
OL,4,CTourists aid French wildfire fight
OL,6,FAround a quarter of a million locals
OL,7,Fand tourists have now been evacuated
OL,8,Ffrom properties, although some have
OL,9,Fcautiously started returning.
OL,11,FThe couple told ITV News that they
OL,12,Fwere taken aback by what was happening
OL,13,Faround them, and felt as though they
OL,14,Fneeded to help when they reached the
OL,15,Fsmall town of Sainte-Livrade-sur-Lot.
OL,17,FPedro told ITV News: "We drove down
OL,18,Fand saw firefighters driving up and
OL,19,Fdown on the motorway to try and beat
OL,20,Fthe fires. We saw the smoke.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/4
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
