FL,360,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1785426509
OL,3,C'We want to do anything we can':
OL,4,CTourists aid French wildfire fight
OL,6,F"We've taken some water and sleeping
OL,7,Fbags. We tried to take clothes but
OL,8,Fthey already had enough."
OL,10,FMadi added: "It was quite shocking
OL,11,Factually and that's why we want to do
OL,12,Fanything we can to help."
OL,14,FOne local firefighter, Corporal Dupuis
OL,15,FByron, said: "There are many people
OL,16,Fwho've been taken from their homes,
OL,17,Fbeen asked to evacuate.
OL,19,F"They're staying in sports halls,
OL,20,Fspaces where they're sleeping on the
OL,21,Ffloor.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/4
