FL,360,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1785426509
OL,3,C'We want to do anything we can':
OL,4,CTourists aid French wildfire fight
OL,6,F"The donations are there to help them
OL,7,Flive and sleep a little better and
OL,8,Falso to help the firefighters eat
OL,9,Fbetter because the firefighters,
OL,10,Fthemselves, have been sleeping on the
OL,11,Fground."
OL,13,FItems already donated include clothes,
OL,14,Fwater, food and blankets.
OL,16,FThe wildfire has been ablaze since
OL,17,Flast week and has already burned
OL,18,Fthrough 162-square-miles of land -
OL,19,Froughly four times the size of Paris.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/4
